If the compiler is compatible

git --version
g++ --version

For cloning
cd "$HOME\Desktop"
git clone https://github.com/gaur-commits/Mini-OS-Simulator.git
cd Mini-OS-Simulator

To run the simulation
g++ main.cpp -o simulator.exe -std=c++17
.\simulator.exe

Just remove .exe for linux

For web application
cd .\Mini-OS-Web\backend
g++ main.cpp -o server.exe -std=c++17 -pthread -lws2_32          for windows
g++ main.cpp -o server -std=c++17 -pthread                       for linux
.\server.exe

